<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: 0 }}>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', width: 1280, height: 720 }}>
    <Box style={{
      width: 1280, height: 44, background: '#F3F1E7', flexDirection: 'row',
      alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between',
      paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60,
    }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#2F4A2B', letterSpacing: 2, fontWeight: 'bold' }}>05　核心功能</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B8A7E', letterSpacing: 2 }}>MedAI</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: 1280, height: 2, background: '#2F4A2B' }} />

    <Box style={{ paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60, paddingTop: 20, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1C1F1A', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}>
        复诊时，不用再凭记忆复述
      </Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#55544A', marginTop: 6 }}>
        三个月发生的事排成一条轴，能投影给医生看；一次问诊整理成一张 A4，能打印、能复制成纯文本。
      </Text>

      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', marginTop: 14, gap: 20 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 660, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
          <Image src="assets/timeline.png" style={{ width: 660, height: 370, objectFit: 'cover', borderRadius: 6, border: '1px solid #D8D4C4' }} />
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#8B8A7E', marginTop: 7, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
            图 5　病程时间轴：建档、用药、问诊、结论排在同一条轴上，按真正发生的时间归日
          </Text>
          <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 10 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1C1F1A' }}>按"真发生时间"归日</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#55544A', marginTop: 4, lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
              用药看 startDate、问诊看 lastMessageAt，不看会被归档刷新的 updatedAt ——
              否则整条轴会挤在最后一次操作的那天。
            </Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 18 }}>
          <Box style={{ width: 250, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Image src="assets/sheet.png" style={{ width: 250, height: 370, objectFit: 'cover', borderRadius: 6, border: '1px solid #D8D4C4' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#8B8A7E', marginTop: 7, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
              图 6　就诊摘要 A4 单页
            </Text>
          </Box>

          <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#2F4A2B', marginBottom: 8 }}>这张纸上有什么</Text>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#33352E', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>· 主诉与病程</Text>
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#33352E', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>· 在服药物 + 过敏史</Text>
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#33352E', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>· 现在可以先做什么</Text>
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#33352E', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>· 什么情况必须就医</Text>
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#33352E', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>· 想问医生的几个问题</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{
              marginTop: 12, background: '#FAF7EF', borderLeft: '4px solid #C0473C',
              paddingTop: 9, paddingBottom: 9, paddingLeft: 12, paddingRight: 12,
            }}>
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#33352E', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#C0473C' }}>模型不可用时退回本地模板</span>，
                绝不给你一张空纸。
              </Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{
              marginTop: 10, background: '#FAF7EF', borderLeft: '4px solid #2F4A2B',
              paddingTop: 9, paddingBottom: 9, paddingLeft: 12, paddingRight: 12,
            }}>
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#33352E', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                纯文本版复制到微信，也不会丢掉过敏史与既往病史。
              </Text>
            </Box>
          </Box>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{
      position: 'absolute', bottom: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 40,
      flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between',
      paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60,
    }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B8A7E' }}>广东医科大学 · MedAI</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#2F4A2B' }}>11 / 14</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
</Slide>
